    "slug": "dashboard-productivity-tips",
    "title": "Five ways to lay out a productive dashboard",
    "description": "Five field-tested ways to lay out a six-cell dashboard — by role, by rhythm, and by attention — plus the placement rules that make any layout stick.",
    "date": "2026-08-01",
